        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Adi nthuk tu cho kanlou mei Pu,",
            "Kalvary ching tatei ai houtang thui makge;",
            "Kandi taanc rui alung padik ngam khou rui.",
            "",
            "He! Lung ning than mak mei nun,",
            "Akum ma thanni cho nang bumaeng ruiham Na?",
            "Rian ra meirui thei bam khou",
            "Duang maan ngam the.",
            "",
            "2. Guang na ti gailou o zei kei pui bam ,",
            "Rianra thei puibam khou ryanra bammei nun guay;",
            "Zai patlou datro tingkao ringpui chaeng khou.",
            "",
            "3. Seitan baan taanmun karanc kumv tuay diu,",
            "Nang bang nunguay khou neihla mei padik diu,",
            "Nang kandih gaipui ram khou guang puni the."
          ]
        }
      }
